# Player Dataset — Column Definitions

## Player / Team Information

**`canonical_player_id`** — Unique ID assigned to the player in the dataset.

**`canonical_player_name`** — Standardized name of the player.

**`canonical_team_name`** — Standardized name of the player's team.

**`canonical_team_id`** — Unique ID assigned to the player's team.

**`competition_code`** — Code identifying the competition or league.

**`season_label`** — Season associated with the player's statistics, such as 2025-26.

**`position_group`** — Broad positional category of the player: GK, DEF, MID, or FWD.

**`native_position`** — More specific position of the player, such as Centre-Back, Right Winger, or Central Midfield.

**`minutes`** — Total number of minutes played by the player.

**`source_file`** — Name of the original file from which the player's record was obtained.

**`player_name_ascii`** — Simplified ASCII version of the player's name used for easier matching.

**`team_name_ascii`** — Simplified ASCII version of the team's name used for easier matching.

**`season_start`** — Calendar year in which the season began.

**`n_stints`** — Number of player-team stints represented by the record.

---

## Eligibility Variables

**`elig_percentiles_eligible`** — Indicates whether the player is eligible for percentile calculations.

**`elig_percentiles_ineligibility_reason`** — Explanation for why a player is not eligible for percentile calculations.

**`elig_scores_eligible`** — Indicates whether the player is eligible for the dataset's scoring calculations.

**`elig_scores_ineligibility_reason`** — Explanation for why a player is not eligible for score calculations.

**`eligible_fit`** — Overall indicator of whether the player meets the dataset's eligibility requirements.

---

## Expected Goals and Chance Creation

**`xg`** — Expected goals generated by the player over the season.

**`xg_p90`** — Expected goals generated by the player per 90 minutes.

**`npxg`** — Non-penalty expected goals generated by the player.

**`npxg_p90`** — Non-penalty expected goals generated per 90 minutes.

**`xa`** — Expected assists generated by the player.

**`xa_p90`** — Expected assists generated per 90 minutes.

**`xgchain`** — Expected-goals contribution from attacking sequences involving the player.

**`xgchain_p90`** — xG Chain contribution per 90 minutes.

**`xgbuildup`** — Expected-goals contribution from build-up sequences involving the player.

**`xgbuildup_p90`** — xG Build-up contribution per 90 minutes.

**`xgchain_excl_buildup_p90`** — xG Chain contribution per 90 minutes excluding build-up contribution.

---

## Attacking / Offensive Metrics

**`shots_p90`** — Number of shots taken per 90 minutes.

**`goals_p90`** — Number of goals scored per 90 minutes.

**`assists_p90`** — Number of assists recorded per 90 minutes.

**`key_passes_p90`** — Number of key passes played per 90 minutes.

**`big_chances_created_p90`** — Number of big chances created per 90 minutes.

**`successful_dribbles_p90`** — Number of successful dribbles completed per 90 minutes.

**`completed_passes_p90`** — Number of completed passes per 90 minutes.

**`goals_minus_xg`** — Difference between actual goals scored and expected goals.

**`goals_minus_npxg`** — Difference between actual goals scored and non-penalty expected goals.

**`finishing_shrunk_delta_per_shot`** — Adjusted estimate of finishing performance relative to expected goals on a per-shot basis.

**`sot_rate`** — Percentage of the player's shots that are on target.

**`npxg_per_shot`** — Non-penalty expected goals generated per shot.

**`xa_per_key_pass`** — Expected assists generated per key pass.

**`buildup_share`** — Share of the relevant team build-up contribution attributed to the player.

**`chance_involvement_p90`** — Player involvement in chance creation per 90 minutes.

**`pen_xg`** — Expected goals generated from penalties.

**`pen_xg_p90`** — Expected goals generated from penalties per 90 minutes.

---

## Passing

**`pass_acc_rate`** — Percentage of the player's passes that are completed accurately.

**`accurate_crosses_p90`** — Number of accurate crosses completed per 90 minutes.

**`accurate_long_balls_p90`** — Number of accurate long balls completed per 90 minutes.

**`inaccurate_pass_rate`** — Percentage of the player's passes that are inaccurate.

**`kp_share_p90`** — Player's share of relevant key-pass activity expressed on a per-90 basis.

---

## Defensive Metrics

**`tackles_p90`** — Number of tackles made per 90 minutes.

**`interceptions_p90`** — Number of interceptions made per 90 minutes.

**`clearances_p90`** — Number of clearances made per 90 minutes.

**`blocks_p90`** — Number of blocks made per 90 minutes.

**`def_actions_p90`** — Total defensive actions made per 90 minutes.

**`tackles_won`** — Total number of tackles won.

**`tackle_win_rate`** — Percentage of tackles that were won.

**`ball_recoveries`** — Total number of times the player recovered the ball.

**`ball_recoveries_p90`** — Number of ball recoveries per 90 minutes.

**`errors_lead_to_goal_p90`** — Errors leading directly to goals per 90 minutes.

---

## Duels and Physical Metrics

**`aerial_duels_won`** — Total number of aerial duels won.

**`ground_duels_won`** — Total number of ground duels won.

**`ground_duels_won_p90`** — Ground duels won per 90 minutes.

**`aerial_duels_won_p90`** — Aerial duels won per 90 minutes.

**`dribble_success_rate`** — Percentage of attempted dribbles that were successful.

**`fouls`** — Total number of fouls committed.

**`fouls_p90`** — Fouls committed per 90 minutes.

---

## Shooting / Ball Actions

**`shots_on_target`** — Total number of shots that were on target.

**`shots_off_target`** — Total number of shots that were off target.

**`offsides`** — Total number of times the player was caught offside.

**`offsides_p90`** — Number of offsides per 90 minutes.

**`goals`** — Total number of goals scored.

**`assists`** — Total number of assists recorded.

**`shots`** — Total number of shots taken.

---

## Statistical Adjustment Variables

**`tackle_win_rate_n`** — Sample size used in calculating the tackle-win rate.

**`tackle_win_rate_shr`** — Shrunk or adjusted version of the tackle-win rate.

**`sot_rate_n`** — Sample size used in calculating the shot-on-target rate.

**`sot_rate_shr`** — Shrunk or adjusted version of the shot-on-target rate.

**`pass_acc_rate_n`** — Sample size used in calculating passing accuracy.

**`pass_acc_rate_shr`** — Shrunk or adjusted version of passing accuracy.

**`dribble_success_rate_n`** — Sample size used in calculating dribble success rate.

**`dribble_success_rate_shr`** — Shrunk or adjusted version of dribble success rate.

